All GeoBase products are available on the Open Government of Canada portal: https://open.canada.ca/data/en/dataset?q=geobase&amp;organization=nrcan-rncan
GeoBase initiative provides geospatial data of the entire Canadian landmass for government, business, and/or personal assessments of sustainable resource development, public safety, sanitation, and environmental protection.  Data is available for download as ESRI Shapefile, FGDB, KML, and GML.</r3d:description>
